---
layout: base.njk
title: Give
permalink: /donate/
description: Gifts pay for the repair — a headstock, a rank of pipes, a panel of glass. Once, or every month, as you like.
---
<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="content stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">Give</span>
    <h1 class="display">Give, <em>quietly</em> if you like.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Gifts pay for the repair — a headstock, a rank of pipes, a panel of glass. Once, or every month, as you like.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="card card--lg card--accent" data-donate>
      <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
        <h2 class="title">Choose an amount</h2>
        <div class="amounts" role="group" aria-label="Amount">
          <button class="amount" type="button" data-amount="50" aria-pressed="false">$50</button>
          <button class="amount" type="button" data-amount="100" aria-pressed="true">$100</button>
          <button class="amount" type="button" data-amount="250" aria-pressed="false">$250</button>
          <button class="amount" type="button" data-amount="1000" aria-pressed="false">$1000</button>
          <button class="amount" type="button" data-amount="other" aria-pressed="false">Another amount</button>
        </div>
        <div class="field" data-custom hidden>
          <label for="custom">How much would you like to give?</label>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="custom" name="custom" type="number" min="1" inputmode="numeric"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox">
          <input id="anon" name="anon" type="checkbox">
          <label for="anon">
            <span class="checkbox__label">Keep my gift anonymous.</span>
            <span class="checkbox__hint">We will not print your name anywhere, and we will not pass it on.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn btn--lg btn--warm" type="button" data-give>Give $100</button>
          <span class="fine faint">No account needed. Once or monthly, your choice on the next step.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card--lg card--accent" data-donate-details hidden>
      <form class="stack" style="gap: var(--space-6);" data-donate-form novalidate>
        <div class="stack stack--xs stack--start">
          <h2 class="title">Your gift</h2>
          <p class="muted m0"><strong data-summary>$100, once</strong> <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-donate-back>Change the amount</button></p>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="fieldset">
          <legend class="fieldset__legend">How often?</legend>
          <div class="amounts" role="group" aria-label="How often">
            <button class="amount amount--freq" type="button" data-freq="once" aria-pressed="true">One time</button>
            <button class="amount amount--freq" type="button" data-freq="monthly" aria-pressed="false">Every month</button>
          </div>
          <span class="field__hint">A monthly gift can be stopped at any time with one email.</span>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fieldset">
          <legend class="fieldset__legend">About you</legend>
          <p class="muted m0 prose" data-anon-note hidden>You asked to stay anonymous. We still need a name and email for the receipt; neither will be published or passed on.</p>
          <div class="grid grid--form">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="dname">Full name<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="dname" name="dname" type="text" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="dname-error"></div>
          <span class="field__error" id="dname-error" data-error-for="dname" hidden></span>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="demail">Email<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="demail" name="demail" type="email" autocomplete="email" required aria-describedby="demail-error"></div>
          <span class="field__error" id="demail-error" data-error-for="demail" hidden></span>
        </div>
          </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="dphone">Phone<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <span class="field__hint">Only used if there is a problem with the gift.</span>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="dphone" name="dphone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required aria-describedby="dphone-error"></div>
          <span class="field__error" id="dphone-error" data-error-for="dphone" hidden></span>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="daddress">Mailing address</label>
          <span class="field__hint">Only if you would like a paper receipt as well.</span>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="daddress" name="daddress" type="text" autocomplete="street-address" aria-describedby="daddress-error"></div>
        </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="fieldset">
          <legend class="fieldset__legend">Payment</legend>
          <div class="handoff" data-stripe-mock>
            <div class="handoff__row">
              <i class="ph ph-lock-simple icon icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p class="m0">Card details are entered on Stripe's secure page, never on this site. When the payment is done, Stripe brings you back here.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="handoff__row handoff__row--meta">
              <span class="fine faint">Powered by Stripe</span>
              <span class="fine faint" data-charge-note>Charged once, today.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn btn--lg btn--warm" type="submit" data-donate-submit>Continue to Stripe</button>
          <span class="fine faint" data-submit-note>$100, once</span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="card card--lg card--accent card--accent-rose" data-donate-success hidden>
      <div class="stack stack--sm stack--start">
        <h2 class="title">Thank you.</h2>
        <p class="muted m0 prose" data-thanks></p>
        <button class="btn btn--secondary" type="button" data-donate-reset>Give again</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
    <div class="card card--lg card--interactive">
      <h3 class="card__title card__title--top">Prefer to mail a check?</h3>
      <p class="muted m0">Make it out to The Ding Dong Foundation, Inc. and send it to the address in the footer. We will write back either way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card card--lg card--interactive">
      <h3 class="card__title card__title--top">Matching gifts and bequests</h3>
      <p class="muted m0">Handled one at a time, by email. There is no portal to log into and no staff to get past.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight section--sunk">
  <div class="content">
    <p class="muted m0">Gifts are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law. A receipt follows by email.</p>
  </div>
</section>
